"baghtatan","f":["F","INDEF","ACC"],"r":491,"l":684},{"i":"22:55:12","a":"أَوْ","t":"or","p":"CONJ","tr":"aw","l":42},{"i":"22:55:13","a":"يَأْتِيَهُمْ","t":"comes to them","p":"V","tr":"yatiyahum","f":["IMPF","3MS","MOOD:SUBJ"],"r":7,"l":48,"g":[["يَأْتِيَ","V","stem","IMPF|3MS|MOOD:SUBJ"],["هُمْ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"22:55:14","a":"عَذَابُ","t":"(the) punishment","p":"N","tr":"ʿadhābu","f":["M","NOM"],"r":17,"l":36},{"i":"22:55:15","a":"يَوْمٍ","t":"(of) a Day","p":"N","tr":"yawmin","f":["M","INDEF","GEN"],"r":13,"l":25},{"i":"22:55:16","a":"عَقِيمٍ","t":"barren","p":"ADJ","tr":"ʿaqīmin","f":["MS","INDEF","GEN"],"r":840,"l":1501},{"e":"٥٥","v":"22:55"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"22:47","t":"And they urge you to hasten the punishment. But Allāh will never fail in His promise. And indeed, a day with your Lord is like a thousand years of those which you count.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"22:48","t":"And for how many a city did I prolong enjoyment while it was committing wrong. Then I seized it, and to Me is the [final] destination.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"22:49","t":"Say, \"O people, I am only to you a clear warner.\"","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"22:50","t":"And those who have believed and done righteous deeds - for them is forgiveness and noble provision.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"22:51","t":"But the ones who strove against Our verses, [seeking] to cause failure - those are the companions of Hellfire.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"22:52","t":"And We did not send before you any messenger or prophet except that when he spoke [or recited], Satan threw into it [some misunderstanding]. But Allāh abolishes that which Satan throws in; then Allāh makes precise His verses. And Allāh is Knowing and Wise.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"22:53","t":"[That is] so He may make what Satan throws in [i.e., asserts] a trial for those within whose hearts is disease and those hard of heart. And indeed, the wrongdoers are in extreme dissension.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"22:54","t":"And so those who were given knowledge may know that it is the truth from your Lord and [therefore] believe in it, and their hearts humbly submit to it. And indeed is Allāh the Guide of those who have believed to a straight path.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"22:55","t":"But those who disbelieve will not cease to be in doubt of it until the Hour comes upon them unexpectedly or there comes to them the punishment of a barren Day.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":55,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":34,"surahs":[22],"sajdah":false}